<section class="honda-collection" aria-labelledby="collection-title">
 <header><p class="eyebrow">Collection preparation</p><h2 id="collection-title">Where is your Honda parked?<br /><span>Plan the handover details.</span></h2><p>Open each note before discussing recovery. No need to move or test a damaged vehicle.</p></header>
 <div class="collection-layout"><figure data-manufacturer-reveal><img src="/sections/honda-crv-assessment.webp" srcset="/sections/honda-crv-assessment-640.webp 640w, /sections/honda-crv-assessment-960.webp 960w, /sections/honda-crv-assessment.webp 1440w" sizes="(max-width:900px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width:1250px) 50vw, 590px" width="1440" height="960" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Used bronze-grey early-2010s CR-V-style Honda SUV with lower-door scratches and bumper wear in an independent UAE workshop" /></figure>
