 <details id="honda-parking" open><summary><i class="ph ph-garage" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Parking &amp; access</h3><i class="ph ph-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><p>Share the exact location, basement height if applicable, entrance width, gates and nearby obstructions. Explain any site permissions needed. Explore our <a href="/locations/">UAE location coverage</a>.</p></details>
 <details id="honda-movement"><summary><i class="ph ph-tire" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Keys &amp; movement</h3><i class="ph ph-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><p>Describe key availability, tyre condition and any known restriction on rolling or steering. Do not test the vehicle to find out. Existing photos can help explain the space around it.</p></details>
 <details id="honda-documents"><summary><i class="ph ph-identification-card" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Documents &amp; release</h3><i class="ph ph-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><p>Explain the ownership and registration documents available and who can authorise handover. Confirm required paperwork and relevant transfer or deregistration steps before arrangements are agreed.</p></details>
 <a class="collection-link" href="/car-removal/">Read the vehicle collection guide <i class="ph ph-truck" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div></div>
</section>
